            <ArticleTitle>Retroperitoneal hamartoma: a rare entity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>79-81</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Retroperitoneal hamartoma in adult is an extremely rare entity. Here we report a case of 23-years-old lady who presented with a large retroperitoneal mass and abdominal pain. The mass was surgically removed and the diagnosis of hamartoma was made on histological findings.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
